  "name": "Slow Cooker Jambalaya",
  "subtitle": "A hearty one-pot meal with chicken, sausage, and shrimp",
  "description": "Chicken, sausage, vegetables, tomatoes, and Cajun spices cook together before shrimp is stirred in at the end.",
